+/* A rollback keeps the live delivery state, as it keeps the output ring: the
+ * consumer is mid-stream and the guest is going back exactly where it was.
+ * Resetting it (as a real load must) re-primed the audio on every rollback,
+ * so a host rolling back each frame (run-ahead, speculative rendering)
+ * output silence and stalled the producer behind the refilling cushion. */
